&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/6" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第6章 女侠正式面见大帅，被当成母畜一样鞭打，女侠主动深喉服侍后被灌满浓精&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://v2dao.store/contents/0df31b80e5884b17b637970a6b9d441a/reader/7" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第7章 女侠被医师闺蜜救出，仔细检查身体疗伤，随后计划杀回去刺杀大帅&lt;/a&gt;
